# ─── Design / handoff references (NOT part of the app) ─────────────────
# Visual mirrors kept only for the Claude Design handoff. Anchored to the
# repo root with a trailing slash so they're matched as directories and
# never re-committed. NOTE: .gitignore does NOT untrack files that are
# already committed — run `git rm -r --cached <dir>` once to purge those.
/admin-frame/
/.design_ref/
